
# ── Telegram contact-form delivery ──────────────────────────────────────────
# The website contact form (/api/contact) sends each enquiry to Telegram.
# 1. In Telegram, message @BotFather → /newbot → copy the token below.
# 2. Message your new bot once (say "hi"), then open:
#    https://api.telegram.org/bot<TOKEN>/getUpdates  and copy "chat":{"id":...}
#    (For a group, add the bot to the group and use the group's negative id.)
# 3. Set both values here AND in Vercel → Project → Settings → Environment Variables.
